forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - repository-artifact-retention\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - tests/unit/browser-effect-boundary-ledger.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/agent-browser-tool.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/agent-browser-service.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/sensitive-sink-enforcement-drift.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/external-content-provenance.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/workspace-external-write-provenance-policy.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - external/derived-untrusted/missing/invalid 来源不得选择 auto-connect / cdp / external-profile；managed 放行；trusted system / direct operator 不受该闸门限制。\n  - click / type 在 external/unknown 来源下必须要求 Main-owned managed 会话，否则拒绝；trusted/operator 不触发 preflight。\n  - 逐 action 记录覆盖：navigate/status/waitForSelector/screenshot/getConsoleMessages 只过连接模式闸门，click/type 另加会话归属闸门。\n  - evaluate / command / close 属副作用型但未接入会话归属闸门，显式记为 residual，不冒充已覆盖。\n  - 不弱化 SSRF / private-network / kill switch；不新建第三套策略（复用既有 external-access-policy 单模块）。\n  - 干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\nexpectedUserBehavior:\n  - 正常 managed 浏览、navigate、等待、截图、控制台诊断继续可用。\n  - 外部/未知来源内容无法显式选择运行中的浏览器、CDP 端点或既有浏览器 profile；也无法在 external/CDP/profile 会话中 click/type。\n  - 直接 operator / trusted system 请求保留既有外部会话与点击/输入路径。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s04-browser-effect-boundary.md\n---\n\n# S04 冻结实施边界\n\nS04 核验既有的单一 agent_browser 边界，不新增第三套策略。两个来源相关判定都在既有模块\n\"'`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/agent-browser-external-access-policy.ts` 中：\n\n- `resolveAgentBrowserExternalAccessPolicy`（连接模式闸门）：external/unknown 来源 + auto-connect/cdp/external-profile 拒绝；managed 放行。被 `agent-browser-tool.ts` 在每次调用（所有 action）前调用。\n- `resolveAgentBrowserSessionEffectPolicy`（会话归属闸门）：external/unknown 来源要求 `connection.mode === \"managed\"`，否则拒绝。仅 `click`/`type` 触发（`shouldPreflightAgentBrowserSessionEffect` 判来源，`assertSessionEffectAllowed` 先做只读 `status` 查询）。\n\n台账在 `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s04-browser-effect-boundary.md`，逐 action 记录“接到哪一步”，并把\n未接入会话归属闸门的副作用型 action 记为 residual。`tests/unit/browser-effect-boundary-ledger.test.ts`\n对纯策略做真值表断言，并对 tool 源码钉住 per-action 接线与残余集合，防止静默扩大或台账过期。\n\n残余（显式记录，不冒充已覆盖）：`evaluate` / `command` / `close` 是副作用型 action，**只**过连接模式闸门，\n**未**接入会话归属闸门；plugin caller / supervised task / broker control/UID 路径也仅按既有 Main 校验，\n不在本包覆盖范围。不弱化 SSRF / private-network / kill switch，不改产品默认值/锁/approval。\n'\"'@; Set-Content -Path harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-browser-effect-boundary.md -Value \"'$body -Encoding utf8; (Get-Content harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-browser-effect-boundary.md).Count'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
